# Evolution: Approved

Spec: ApprovedIndex
Purpose:
  Registry of approved concepts, skills, and decisions that have passed
  validation and been promoted to canonical knowledge or active use.

Owns: evolution/approved/

Structure:
  Approved items are .sdd files with @approved.APPX IDs.
  Status field: approved | active | deprecated | archived

Rules:
  [APP-01] Approved items MUST be referenced by canonical @namespace.id.
  [APP-02] Approved items are immutable — new variants get new versions.
  [APP-03] Deprecation follows the L0-L5 promotion pipeline.

Navigation:
  Parent: @../INDEX.sdd
  Proposals: @../proposals/INDEX.sdd
  Candidates: @../candidates/INDEX.sdd
  Concepts: @../../concepts/INDEX.sdd
  Skills: @../../skills/INDEX.sdd

State: +
